msgstr "拒绝不完整的实体"

#: ../../region-schem-rs/src/config.rs:49
msgid ""
"An entity or block entity without a position or an id fails the load instead "
"of being skipped. Off by default: WorldEdit does not store entities, so the "
"files it writes have none, and one broken entry should not cost the whole "
"schematic."
msgstr ""
"缺少位置或 id 的实体或方块实体将导致加载失败，而不是被跳过。默认关闭："
"WorldEdit 不保存实体，因此它写出的文件没有实体，而且不应因一条损坏的记录而放"
"弃整个 schematic。"

#: ../../region-schem-rs/src/config.rs:96
msgid "Sponge Format Version"
msgstr "Sponge 格式版本"

#: ../../region-schem-rs/src/config.rs:98
msgid ""
"Which version to write: 0 keeps the version the file was read from (2 when "
"that is unknown), 1 is the legacy layout, 2 is what WorldEdit 7 writes and 3 "
"is the current one. Writing 2 from a version 3 file packs its per-block "
"biomes into one per column."
msgstr ""
"写入哪个版本：0 保持文件读入时的版本（未知时为 2），1 是旧版布局，2 是 "
"WorldEdit 7 写出的版本，3 是当前版本。将版本 3 的文件写为 2 时，会把逐方块的"
"生物群系合并为每列一个。"

